 g in Region 7 courts\, the Hancock County Superior Court will be closed al
 l day to the public beginning Tuesday\, July 21st through Friday\, July 24
 th. Monday\, July 27th through Friday\, July 31st\, the court will be clos
 ed in the mornings\, from 8am to noon for Administrative Week.\n  - Please
