 mation and instructions on how to submit an emergency filing when the cour
 t is closed.\n  - Washington County Superior Court - Machias\n  - In prepa
 ration for the launch of Maine eCourts and eFiling in Region 7 courts\, th
 e Washington County Superior Court will be closed all day to the public be
 ginning Thursday\, July 16th through Friday\, July 24th. Monday\, July 27t
 h through Friday\, July 31st\, the court will be closed in the mornings\, 
